<div data-kv-root data-klic-material="surface" data-kv-component="avatar-group" data-kv-variant="reviewers" data-klic-component="avatar-group" class="kn-avatar-group"><header data-part="heading"><strong>검토 진행 · 2/3</strong></header><div class="ku-row" data-part="row"><span><span aria-label="김" data-part="avatar">김</span> 김하늘</span><span><span data-part="badge">✓ 검토 완료</span></span></div><div class="ku-row" data-part="row"><span><span aria-label="이" data-part="avatar">이</span> 이도윤</span><span><span data-part="badge">✓ 검토 완료</span></span></div><div class="ku-row" data-part="row"><span><span aria-label="박" data-part="avatar">박</span> 박서연</span><span><span data-part="badge">검토 대기</span></span></div><label data-part="progress-label">검토 완료<span>67%</span><progress max="100" value="67">67%</progress></label></div>
